VL  - 9
SP  - 673215
DO  - 10.3389/fenvs.2021.673215
UR  - https://doi.org/10.3389/fenvs.2021.673215
N1  - Real hydrological modeling specific to the Llanos/Orinoquia -- but NOT a CN source. Uses the ABCD model (Thomas 1981) plus a river-floodplain interaction model, calibrated against 57 gauging stations across 4,273 hydrological units; parameters regionalized by morphometric similarity, not vegetation/land-cover classification. Does not use the SCS curve number method at all. Valuable as regional precedent and a possible cross-validation reference once a CN-based patch exists for this biome, not as a direct parameter source -- don't conflate with Oliveira et al. 2016 above.
ER  -

